WEBVTT

02:46.030 --> 02:48.400
<b>The outer city has fallen! Everyone 
retreat into the inner city!</b>

02:48.400 --> 02:49.830
<b>Everyone! Quickly!</b>

04:11.140 --> 04:12.730
<b>I'm not going to make it!</b>

04:33.970 --> 04:37.220
<b>Is this guy... also attacking the city?!</b>

04:48.970 --> 04:50.390
<b>What the hell is that?!</b>

04:50.390 --> 04:51.300
<b>Mo Fan!</b>

04:52.800 --> 04:54.220
<b>Why are you guys here?</b>

04:54.900 --> 04:56.180
<b>Why aren't you retreating?</b>

04:56.180 --> 04:57.420
<b>I need to go to Bo City Street.</b>

04:57.420 --> 04:58.720
<b>Wang Sanpang and the others are there.</b>

04:59.280 --> 05:01.700
<b>I don't want to encounter 
the same thing twice.</b>

05:01.700 --> 05:04.310
<b>That's right. We can't just abandon them.</b>

05:05.620 --> 05:07.890
<b>All right. Then I'll come with
 you to Bo City Street first.</b>

05:07.890 --> 05:09.390
<b>What about Zhang Xiaohou and the others?</b>

05:09.840 --> 05:11.040
<b>They can handle it.</b>

05:11.040 --> 05:12.870
<b>Let's finish up on our end first.</b>

05:12.870 --> 05:16.000
<b>Wang Sanpang is your
classmate, but he's mine too.</b>

05:16.000 --> 05:17.640
<b>I'm coming too.</b>

05:20.660 --> 05:22.670
<b>Without me to
 show you shortcuts,</b>

05:22.670 --> 05:24.640
<b>you'll never outrun those bastards.</b>

05:26.650 --> 05:28.720
<b>Do you guys have any other 
family at the north wall?</b>

05:29.250 --> 05:32.350
<b>Just my uncle, but he went to 
the inner city early this morning.</b>

05:33.200 --> 05:34.150
<b>That's good.</b>

05:34.150 --> 05:37.290
<b>Let's leave now and hope they haven't 
scattered too far from one another!</b>

05:51.840 --> 05:54.140
<b>Mo Fan, aren't you still recovering
your magical energy?</b>

05:54.140 --> 05:56.560
<b>I have some medicine here. 
It can help your recovery.</b>

05:57.770 --> 05:58.930
<b>Thanks.</b>

06:00.020 --> 06:02.590
<b>At our speed, we should be able 
to retreat to the inner walls</b>

06:02.590 --> 06:04.980
<b>before this whole place is 
overrun by the undead, right?</b>

06:04.980 --> 06:07.890
<b>I can get around Tin City with 
my eyes closed. Don't you worry!</b>

06:12.830 --> 06:14.460
<b>But those people...</b>

06:14.460 --> 06:16.430
<b>A lot of them won't make it 
to the inner city in time.</b>

06:17.430 --> 06:18.290
<b>Run!</b>

06:18.290 --> 06:19.420
<b>Run, quickly!</b>

06:19.420 --> 06:20.100
<b>Run!</b>

06:22.240 --> 06:24.820
<b>Look! What's that thing in the sky?</b>

06:24.820 --> 06:26.390
<b>It looks like a ball of flesh!</b>

06:26.390 --> 06:28.430
<b>Why would a piece of flesh 
be as big as a building?!</b>

06:28.430 --> 06:29.560
<b>It has eyes!</b>

06:29.560 --> 06:31.470
<b>It's terrifying!</b>

06:34.090 --> 06:35.180
<b>It's that thing!</b>

06:42.100 --> 06:42.930
<b>Oh no!</b>

06:47.970 --> 06:48.780
<b>Run!</b>

06:48.780 --> 06:49.640
<b>Help!</b>

06:49.640 --> 06:51.640
<b>Is it a heavy transport 
unit or something?!</b>

07:05.280 --> 07:06.870
<b>Bastard!</b>

07:07.920 --> 07:10.390
<b>To think those bastards still had 
this trick up their sleeves!</b>

07:10.390 --> 07:12.970
<b>Now we really can't say if 
we'll outrun them or not!</b>

07:13.360 --> 07:16.270
<b>We have to outrun them! 
Otherwise, we'll all die!</b>

07:16.270 --> 07:20.430
<b>Normally, the city wall would be able
 to slow the undead army a bit...</b>

07:21.550 --> 07:23.850
<b>That Flesh Mound Corpse 
Official has its eyes on us!</b>

07:27.680 --> 07:28.640
<b>Let's run!</b>

09:03.280 --> 09:04.630
<b>You guys!</b>

09:04.630 --> 09:06.260
<b>You normally act all cocky,</b>

09:06.260 --> 09:08.480
<b>but now you're all cowering 
like turtles in their shells!</b>

09:08.480 --> 09:12.480
<b>We citizens pay you guys 
so that you protect us!</b>

09:12.480 --> 09:14.800
<b>Now that we're being run down by undead,</b>

09:14.800 --> 09:18.090
<b>you're all standing around watching!</b>

09:18.090 --> 09:21.240
<b>Where has your conscience 
gone?! You bastards!</b>

09:29.410 --> 09:31.810
<b>Captain, just how long must we wait?!</b>

09:32.190 --> 09:35.390
<b>If we continue like this,
 we'll let the citizens down!</b>

09:35.710 --> 09:38.680
<b>Shouldn't we mages step 
forward at times like these?</b>

09:38.680 --> 09:40.430
<b>Especially for us, the Imperial Magicians!</b>

09:41.220 --> 09:44.200
<b>The people of Tin City refer 
to us as the City's Shield,</b>

09:44.200 --> 09:45.520
<b>the Honorable Magicians,</b>

09:45.520 --> 09:47.520
<b>but where is our honor now?</b>

09:47.770 --> 09:49.560
<b>Zuo Feng, calm down!</b>

09:51.000 --> 09:52.770
<b>Mr. President!</b>

09:52.770 --> 09:53.790
<b>President Han...</b>

09:54.540 --> 09:56.720
<b>Lu Huan, the situation's changed!</b>

09:58.420 --> 09:59.600
<b>All imperial mages, listen up!</b>

10:00.090 --> 10:01.310
<b>Towards the outer city!</b>

10:01.310 --> 10:03.020
<b>Eliminate the Flesh Mound 
Corpse Officials!</b>

10:15.640 --> 10:19.480
<b>If I'm not mistaken, your family 
is at the south wall, right?</b>

10:20.180 --> 10:21.020
<b>Yes.</b>

10:21.020 --> 10:22.520
<b>Any news?</b>

10:25.280 --> 10:26.280
<b>Do you need...</b>

10:26.280 --> 10:27.380
<b>There's no time.</b>

10:27.870 --> 10:30.970
<b>I can't go anywhere, and
I won't do anything right now.</b>

10:31.400 --> 10:39.160
<b>My duty right now is to behead that 
skeletal creature when it flies to us.</b>

10:39.160 --> 10:40.970
<b>Or I die trying.</b>

10:58.250 --> 10:59.870
<b>The place is overrun with undead!</b>

10:59.870 --> 11:01.930
<b>Just how many of these things are there?!</b>

11:02.720 --> 11:03.720
<b>What do we do now?</b>

11:04.320 --> 11:05.820
<b>We can't save anyone like that.</b>

11:05.820 --> 11:08.060
<b>We've already used up a lot 
of our magical energy.</b>

11:08.060 --> 11:10.420
<b>We have a lot to do going forward, too.</b>

11:11.240 --> 11:12.140
<b>Stick to the plan!</b>

11:27.470 --> 11:28.420
<b>We're almost there!</b>

11:28.420 --> 11:30.770
<b>We'll arrive at Bo City Street 
after crossing this overpass!</b>

11:41.140 --> 11:42.920
<b>Hurry and find the person 
you're looking for.</b>

11:42.920 --> 11:45.100
<b>Then I'll take you guys on a
detour to the inner city!</b>

11:51.430 --> 11:52.780
<b>Help...</b>

11:52.780 --> 11:53.770
<b>Help me!</b>

11:57.600 --> 12:00.000
<b>Help! Help!</b>

12:00.000 --> 12:00.890
<b>What is it doing?</b>

12:09.810 --> 12:10.810
<b>Mo Fan!</b>

12:10.810 --> 12:12.470
<b>Does that kid want to die?!</b>

12:14.590 --> 12:15.970
<b>Good stuff!</b>

12:16.800 --> 12:18.300
<b>He cast Fleeting Shadow twice in a row.</b>

12:18.300 --> 12:20.270
<b>Has he reached Single-Thought Nebula?</b>

12:24.910 --> 12:26.440
<b>I've had it!</b>

12:26.440 --> 12:28.310
<b>Let's slay this bastard undead!</b>

12:28.550 --> 12:29.220
<b>Yes!</b>

12:30.560 --> 12:31.850
<b>Ice Shackles!</b>

12:35.320 --> 12:36.420
<b>Follow me!</b>

12:46.600 --> 12:48.390
<b>This guy is ugly as hell!</b>

12:48.840 --> 12:50.210
<b>That's a Demon of Disaster.</b>

12:50.210 --> 12:52.350
<b>It likes to hide in the dark like a bat.</b>

12:53.010 --> 12:56.920
<b>It flies over its prey and pierces 
a hole in its prey's head.</b>

12:57.580 --> 13:01.300
<b>Next thing you know, blood and brain 
matter spew out from that hole.</b>

13:02.330 --> 13:03.870
<b>Just be careful of its index finger.</b>

13:03.870 --> 13:05.880
<b>It suddenly extends a hidden claw.</b>

13:05.880 --> 13:08.510
<b>It just needs to poke you in 
the head, and you're dead.</b>

13:08.510 --> 13:10.270
<b>A lot of Magic Armor 
can't defend against it.</b>

13:11.520 --> 13:14.080
<b>You said that it likes
 to hide in the dark.</b>

13:14.080 --> 13:16.160
<b>Does that mean that it 
has the shadow element?</b>

13:16.160 --> 13:17.040
<b>That's right.</b>

13:17.040 --> 13:19.390
<b>So your Giant Shadow Spikes 
are useless against it.</b>

13:19.390 --> 13:22.400
<b>And this guy's really 
good at running away.</b>

13:22.400 --> 13:24.290
<b>The moment it senses 
something off, it'll run</b>

13:24.290 --> 13:27.390
<b>and harass us from the sky.</b>

13:27.680 --> 13:30.430
<b>So basically, it's just a bat demon.</b>

13:39.720 --> 13:41.390
<b>Going up against the 
Great Nyx Regime Formation?</b>

13:41.390 --> 13:42.180
<b>Shorty!</b>

13:43.880 --> 13:45.980
<b>Brilliant Light: Purify!</b>

13:50.000 --> 13:51.100
<b>Ice Shackles!</b>

14:07.940 --> 14:09.780
<b>It can't use Fleeting Shadow or fly.</b>

14:09.780 --> 14:11.430
<b>It's not much of a threat to us anymore.</b>

14:12.290 --> 14:14.160
<b>It's pretty unlucky to have run into us.</b>

14:14.160 --> 14:15.640
<b>Mo Fan, it's your turn!</b>

14:32.220 --> 14:34.860
<b>Thunderbolt: Wild Strikes!</b>

14:53.660 --> 14:54.940
<b>Now that's just too violent.</b>

14:54.940 --> 14:59.270
<b>I've never seen an intermediate-tier mage 
basically one-shot a warrior-rank undead!</b>

14:59.760 --> 15:00.930
<b>Groundbreak!</b>

15:16.470 --> 15:17.580
<b>Still want to run?</b>

15:33.510 --> 15:36.220
<b>Okay, okay! Don't beat it to the 
point of destroying the crystal!</b>

15:41.590 --> 15:42.220
<b>Take this.</b>

15:42.740 --> 15:44.770
<b>This thing can quickly recover 
your magical energy.</b>

15:44.770 --> 15:46.890
<b>It's way better than the 
slow-acting medicine.</b>

15:47.390 --> 15:49.430
<b>Really? That's great!</b>

15:49.810 --> 15:52.440
<b>The first time, it can recover about 
a quarter of your magical energy.</b>

15:52.440 --> 15:55.200
<b>But the second time, it can 
only recover an eighth.</b>

15:55.200 --> 15:58.770
<b>It'll continue to decrease by half each 
time, up to... about five, six times.</b>

16:00.090 --> 16:01.720
<b>We're still far from the inner city.</b>

16:01.720 --> 16:04.470
<b>We need to save our magical 
energy on the way.</b>

16:04.470 --> 16:09.470
<b>BO CITY STREET</b>

16:27.860 --> 16:29.210
<b>Please, I beg you, stop crying!</b>

16:29.210 --> 16:31.470
<b>If you alert the undead to us, 
we're all going to die!</b>

16:35.140 --> 16:37.910
<b>This was originally 
meant to capture demons.</b>

16:37.910 --> 16:40.180
<b>Now we're all trapped in this.</b>

16:40.180 --> 16:41.990
<b>Stop complaining!</b>

16:41.990 --> 16:43.220
<b>If it weren't for my idea,</b>

16:43.220 --> 16:45.270
<b>you all would've been
dragged off by the undead.</b>

16:45.270 --> 16:48.200
<b>But... just staying in here 
isn't a solution, either.</b>

16:48.200 --> 16:49.850
<b>Maybe we should leave?</b>

16:49.850 --> 16:52.800
<b>Didn't I already tell you, that 
there's no path through ahead?</b>

16:52.800 --> 16:54.430
<b>Everyone who went there ended up dead!</b>

16:55.420 --> 16:58.100
<b>Mu Bai told us to wait here. 
He'll be here very soon.</b>

16:59.030 --> 17:00.970
<b>Do you want to give him a call and ask?</b>

17:00.970 --> 17:02.450
<b>Why isn't he here yet...</b>

17:08.580 --> 17:09.390
<b>They're here!</b>

17:14.570 --> 17:16.080
<b>Mu Bai, you—</b>

17:17.200 --> 17:18.640
<b>How many people did Mu Bai bring?</b>

17:19.840 --> 17:21.130
<b>Quickly! Back into the cage!</b>

17:21.130 --> 17:22.020
<b>It's undead!</b>

17:22.020 --> 17:23.270
<b>So many undead!</b>

17:30.300 --> 17:33.300
<b>Translator: Bridget Kan</b>

17:33.300 --> 17:36.300
<b>Editor: Salem Alabanza</b>

17:36.300 --> 17:39.300
<b>Quality Control: Gabriella Alabanza</b>

17:39.300 --> 17:42.300
<b>Timer and Final Quality Control:
Henry Lin</b>

18:59.180 --> 19:01.310
<b><i>They'll devour us sooner or later!</i></b>

19:02.270 --> 19:03.310
<b><i>Imperial Magicians?</i></b>

19:03.310 --> 19:05.390
<b><i>These guys are elites!</i></b>

19:06.140 --> 19:08.850
<b><i>I'm just one step away from my 49 Stars.</i></b>

19:08.850 --> 19:11.390
<b><i>Please don't let that guy run over here.</i></b>

19:16.720 --> 19:18.970
<b><i>Mo Fan! Are you waiting for 
New Year's or something?!</i></b>

19:18.970 --> 19:20.600
<b><i>Fire Burst: Rupture!</i></b>

19:21.430 --> 19:23.220
<b><i>Lightning Strike: Electric Field!</i></b>

19:25.720 --> 19:29.470
<b><i>Is my magical energy... 
about to be depleted?</i></b>
